  "job_B15.6.24_20251003_114331": {
    "text": "Ic \u00e6lfred cingc mid Godes gife & mid ge\u00feeahtunge \u00e6\u00feeredes ercebisceopes & ealra Westseaxena witena\nAc hit gelamp \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6\u00f0elbold gefor.\n& wyt \u00e6\u00feered, mid ealra Westseaxena witena gewitnesse, uncerne d\u00e6l o\u00f0f\u00e6stan \u00e6\u00feelbyrhte cingce\n& he \u00fea swa dyde, ge \u00fe\u00e6t yrfe, ge \u00fe\u00e6t he mid uncre gemanan begeat, & \u00fe\u00e6t he sylf gestrynde.\n\u00dea hit swa gelamp \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6\u00feered to feng, \u00fea b\u00e6d ic hine beforan urum witum eallum \u00fe\u00e6t wyt \u00fe\u00e6t yrfe\n\u00dea s\u00e6de he me \u00fe\u00e6t he naht ea\u00f0e ne mihte tod\u00e6lan for\u00feon he h\u00e6fde ful oft \u00e6r ongefangen.\n& he cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee he on uncrum gemanan gebruce & gestrynde \u00e6fter his d\u00e6ge he nanum menn sel ne\n& ic \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fea w\u00e6s wel ge\u00feafa.\nAc hit gelamp \u00fe\u00e6t we ealle on h\u00e6\u00f0enum folce gebrocude w\u00e6ron.\n\u00dea spr\u00e6ce wyt ymbe uncre bearn, \u00fe\u00e6t hy sumre are be\u00feorftan, s\u00e6lde unc on \u00feam brocum swa unc\n\u00dea w\u00e6ron we on gemote \u00e6t Swinbeorgum, \u00fea gecw\u00e6don wit on Westseaxena witena gewitnesse \u00fe\u00e6t\n& \u00fe\u00e6s uncer \u00e6g\u00f0er o\u00ferum his wedd sealde, swa\u00f0er uncer leng lifede, \u00fe\u00e6t se fenge \u00e6g\u00feer ge to lande ge\nAc hit gelamp \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6\u00f0ered cingc gefor.\n\u00dea ne cydde me nan mann nan yrfegewrit ne nane gewitnesse \u00fe\u00e6t hit \u00e6nig o\u00f0er w\u00e6re butan swa wit on\n\u00dea gehyrde we nu manegu yrfegeflitu, nu \u00fea l\u00e6dde ic A\u00feulfes cinges yrfegewrit on ure gemot \u00e6t\n\u00dea hit ar\u00e6d w\u00e6s, \u00fea b\u00e6d ic hy ealle for minre lufan, & him min wedd bead \u00fe\u00e6t ic hyra n\u00e6fre n\u00e6nne ne\n& hy \u00fea ealle to rihte gerehton & cw\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t hy nan rihtre riht ge\u00feencan ne mihtan ne on \u00feam\nNu hit eall agan is \u00fe\u00e6ron o\u00f0 \u00feine hand, \u00feonne \u00feu hit becwe\u00f0e & sylle swa gesibre handa swa fremdre\n& hi ealle me \u00fe\u00e6s hyra wedd sealdon & hyra handsetene \u00fe\u00e6t be hyra life hit n\u00e6nig mann n\u00e6fre ne\nIc \u00c6lfred Westseaxena cingc mid Godes gyfe & mid \u00feisse gewitnesse, gecwe\u00f0e hu ic ymbe min yrfe\n\u00c6rest ic an Eadwearde minum yldran suna \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00e6t Str\u00e6tneat on Triconscire & Heortigtunes &\n& ic him an \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00e6t Cantuctune & \u00e6t Bedewindan & \u00e6t Pefesigge & Hysseburnan & \u00e6t Suttune\n& ealle \u00fea bocland \u00fee ic on Cent h\u00e6bbe & \u00e6t \u00feam ny\u00f0eran Hysseburnan & \u00e6t Cyseldene, agyfe man in\n& \u00feam gingran minan suna \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00e6t Eaderingtune & \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6t Dene & \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6t Meone & \u00e6t\n& minre yldstan dehter \u00fe\u00e6ne ham \u00e6t Welewe & \u00fe\u00e6re medemestan \u00e6t Clearna & \u00e6t Cendefer & \u00fe\u00e6re\n& \u00e6\u00f0elme mines bro\u00f0er suna \u00feone ham \u00e6t Ealdingburnan & \u00e6t Cumtune & \u00e6t Crundellan & \u00e6t\n& A\u00feelwolde mines bro\u00f0or suna \u00feone ham \u00e6t Godelmingum & \u00e6t Gyldeforda & \u00e6t St\u00e6ningum.\n& Osfer\u00f0e minum m\u00e6ge \u00feone ham \u00e6t Beccanlea & \u00e6t Hry\u00f0eranfelda & \u00e6t Diccelingum & \u00e6t Su\u00f0tune\n& Ealhswi\u00f0e \u00feone ham \u00e6t Lambburnan & \u00e6t Waneting & \u00e6t E\u00f0andune.\n& minum twam sunum an \u00feusend punda, \u00e6g\u00f0rum fif hund punda.\n& minre yldstan dehter & \u00fe\u00e6re medemestan & \u00fe\u00e6re gingstan & Ealhswi\u00f0e, him feowrum feower hund\n& minra ealdormanna \u00e6lcum an hund mangcusa & \u00e6\u00feelme & A\u00f0elwolde & Osfer\u00f0e eac swa &\n& \u00feam mannum \u00fee me folgia\u00f0, \u00fee ic nu on Eastertidum feoh sealde, twa hund punda agyfe man him &\n& \u00feam ercebisceope C mancusa & Esne bisceope & W\u00e6rfer\u00f0e bisceope & \u00feam \u00e6t Scireburnan.\nEac swa ged\u00e6le for me & for minne f\u00e6der & for \u00fea frynd \u00fee he fore\u00feingode & ic fore\u00feingie, twa hund\n& ic nat naht gewislice hw\u00e6\u00f0er \u00fe\u00e6s feos swa micel is, ne ic nat \u00feeah his mare sy, butan swa ic wene.\nGyf hit mare sy, beo hit him eallum gem\u00e6ne \u00fee ic feoh becweden h\u00e6bbe.\n& ic wille \u00fe\u00e6t mine ealdormenn & mine \u00feenigmenn \u00fe\u00e6r ealle mid syndan & \u00feis \u00feus ged\u00e6lan.\n\u00deonne h\u00e6fde ic \u00e6r on o\u00f0re wisan awriten ymbe min yrfe \u00fea ic h\u00e6fde mare feoh & ma maga & h\u00e6fde\n\u00deonne h\u00e6bbe ic nu forb\u00e6rned \u00fea ealdan \u00fee ic geahsian mihte.\nGif hyra hwylc funden bi\u00f0, ne forstent \u00fe\u00e6t naht, for\u00feam ic wille \u00fe\u00e6t hit nu \u00feus sy mid Godes fultume.\n& ic wille \u00fea menn \u00fee \u00fea land habba\u00f0, \u00fea word gel\u00e6stan \u00fee on mines f\u00e6der yrfegewrite standa\u00f0 swa\n& ic wylle gif ic \u00e6nigum menn \u00e6nig feoh unleanod h\u00e6bbe, \u00fe\u00e6t mine magas \u00fe\u00e6t huru geleanian.\n& ic wylle \u00fea menn \u00fee ic mine bocland becweden h\u00e6bbe, \u00fe\u00e6t hy hit ne asyllan of minum cynne ofer\nAc ic wille ofer hyra d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6t hit gange on \u00fea nyhstan hand me butan hyra hwylc bearn h\u00e6bbe.\n\u00deonne is me leofast \u00fe\u00e6t hit gange on \u00fe\u00e6t stryned on \u00fea w\u00e6pnedhealfe \u00fea hwile \u00fee \u00e6nig \u00fe\u00e6s wyr\u00f0e sy.\nMin yldra f\u00e6der h\u00e6fde gecweden his land on \u00fea sperehealfe n\u00e6s on \u00fea spinlhealfe.\n\u00deonne gif ic gesealde \u00e6nigre wifhanda \u00fe\u00e6t he gestrynde, \u00feonne forgyldan mine magas, & gif hy hit be\nGif hit elles sy, gange hit ofer hyra d\u00e6g swa swa we \u00e6r gecweden h\u00e6fdon.\nFor\u00feon ic cwe\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t hi hit gyldan, for\u00feon hy fo\u00f0 to minum, \u00fee ic syllan mot swa wifhanda swa\n& ic bidde on Godes naman & on his haligra \u00fe\u00e6t minra maga nan ne yrfewearda ne geswence nan\n& me Westseaxena witan to rihte gerehton \u00fe\u00e6t ic hi mot l\u00e6tan swa freo swa \u00feeowe, swa\u00f0er ic wille.\nAc ic for Godes lufan & for minre sawle \u00feearfe wylle \u00fe\u00e6t hy syn heora freolses wyr\u00f0e & hyra cyres.\n& ic on Godes lifiendes naman beode \u00fe\u00e6t hy nan man ne brocie ne mid feos manunge ne mid\n& ic wylle \u00fe\u00e6t man agyfe \u00feam hiwum \u00e6t Domrahamme hyra landbec & hyra freols swylce hand to\n& sec man eac on cwicum ceape ymbe minre sawle \u00feearfe swa hit beon m\u00e6ge & swa hit eac gerysne",
